<<<
Intaglio is opposed to relief as a name for the kind of carving in which the design, instead of projecting from the surface, is sunk below it (carved in i.); & to cameo as the name for gems of the same kind but carved in i. instead of in relief.
===
*Intaglio* is opposed to *relief* as a name for the kind of carving in which the design, instead of projecting from the surface, is sunk below it (*carved in i.*); & to *cameo* as the name for gems of the same kind but carved in i. instead of in relief.
>>>

